---
---
<div data-reveal class="mt-[clamp(20px,2.4vw,30px)] bg-white rounded-[20px] ring-1 ring-[#F06FCB]/25 shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(12,22,48,.08),0_24px_70px_rgba(200,79,174,.35)] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-4 border-b border-[#E1E4EC]">
    <span class="brand-sym grid place-items-center w-11 h-11 rounded-full text-white text-[13px] font-extrabold flex-none">HR</span>
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="m-0 text-[16px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.2px] text-ink">¿No sabés cuál programa es para vos?</p>
      <p class="m-0 text-[12.5px] text-[#5C6B8A]">Asistente HR · respuesta inmediata</p>
    </div>
    <span class="ml-auto flex-none flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-bold text-[#098375]"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#128C7E] animate-pulse"></span>En línea</span>
  </div>

  <div data-plan-thread class="px-5 sm:px-6 py-5 flex flex-col gap-3 bg-[#F8F7FC] min-h-[160px] max-h-[420px] overflow-y-auto">
    <div class="self-start max-w-[75%] px-5 py-3.5 rounded-[18px] rounded-bl-[6px] bg-white border border-[#E1E4EC] text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-ink">
      Hola, soy el asistente de HR Strategy Partners. Contame brevemente qué está pasando en tu empresa y te recomiendo el programa adecuado.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 border-t border-[#E1E4EC]">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#F8F7FC] rounded-full pl-6 pr-1.5 py-1.5 border border-[#E1E4EC]">
      <input
        data-plan-input
        type="text"
        placeholder="Escribí tu situación…"
        class="flex-1 min-w-0 border-0 outline-none bg-transparent text-[15px] text-ink"
      />
      <button
        data-plan-submit
        type="button"
        aria-label="Enviar"
        class="flex-none grid place-items-center w-[44px] h-[44px] rounded-full bg-brand-blue text-white hover:bg-[#153E7E] transition"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-[18px] h-[18px] fill-current" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.01 21L23 12 2.01 3 2 10l15 2-15 2z"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
